<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR RATES FLAT AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR RATES FLAT AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>were unchanged at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Friday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate was unchanged at 3.20 percent.</p>
<p>				     Sept 27 fix	    Sept 26 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.10 pct		3.10 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.15 pct		3.15 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.20 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.33 pct		3.34 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.45 pct		3.45 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.55 pct		3.56 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
